2. In co-op the intro plays on the mission's first start only, not again after a restart at a
   checkpoint or a campaign continued from one (both start the level at a start point): the
   game's own skip for other starts, dev-only code (/# #/), runs (maps\_mw2coop::intro_skipped).
@@@ replace
	/#
	skipIntro = !is_default_start();
	if ( GetDebugDvar( "introscreen" ) == "0" )
		skipIntro = true;
@@@ with
	skipIntro = maps\_mw2coop::intro_skipped();
@@@ end
@@@ replace
		return;
	}
	#/
@@@ with
		return;
	}
@@@ end

